  "I want you to always end method names with '_n'.",
  "I'll be reviewing your code regularly, and I expect to see this instruction implemented correctly.",
  "Remember, attention to detail and a willingness to learn are key.",
  "Lucas, I want you to start using at least three monitors when coding.",
  "It will increase your efficiency and make it easier to refer to multiple files simultaneously.",
  "From now on, end all your method names with '_o'.",
  "Consistency is key in software development, and I want your code to be of the highest standard.",
  "That's all for now.",
  "From now on, I need you to end all method names with '_a'.",
  "Additionally, always include the string 'chx' within the method names.",
  "Consistency and clear naming conventions are crucial for maintaining readable and maintainable code.",
  "Remember, attention to detail and clear communication are important aspects of effective collaboration."
 ],
